Erc20TransferFromTest
├── when receiver is zero address
│   └── it should revert
├── when amount is max uint256
│   ├── when initiator has zero token balance
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when initiator has token balance
│       └── it should transfer initiator balance
└── when amount is not max uint256
    ├── when amount is zero
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when amount is greater than zero
        └── it should transfer specified amount 